{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方两行最大字号的标题，紫色强调的“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”和“连那些气也肯再受”最抢眼；随后下方同样醒目的“一阵心慌，连往下想都不敢了”吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只能初步看出他在纠结是否回到一个曾经有归属感、但也曾受过委屈的地方；具体纠结的原因和处境需要进一步读句子。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、怕孤单、心慌、退缩。\",\n  \"missed\": \"中间文字关于重新遇见过去的自己、那扇门不再像从前一样召唤，以及问题仍没有简单答案的具体内容；右上角三个阶段目录的具体信息。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方主标题虽然字号很大，但句子较长，包含舍不得归属感、害怕孤独、甚至愿意再次忍受委屈等多层意思，需要读完整句才能理清处境。\",\n    \"核心感受“心慌、连往下想都不敢”放在下方另一处同样醒目的大字中，需要把它与上方的纠结联系起来才能理解两者的关系。\",\n    \"中间四行连续的小字号文字形成一块较密集的信息区，快速扫视时难以直接提取重点。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a3e59b43-e63c-4076-8a7c-b3f1f12c2641", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013349791311Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:34:49.958509+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2bab52231f6662a33782b6bdcc24dff1291ea11fee5d7ee50b38fdd8a1175b99", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013349791311Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7b23dca96e0a69ac1496fda5500fd801b5931e3d07ab67ec09011773ee03d6d6"}}}
